; gripper_pick_z85_x30: 1 offsets x 30 = 30 trials, randomised, seed 1937305770
; centre X 69.5, Y 178.4; offsets [0.0] -> X 69.5
; Z approach 65, grip 85, release 83 (+Z is DOWN)
; WARNING the release is 2 mm ABOVE the grip, so the plate FALLS 2 mm every trial. Declared deliberately.
; data -> ~/gripper_captures/offsets_z85_<stamp>_plate.csv and _pcb.csv on the Pi, joined on wall_clock, copied to the NAS
; PREFLIGHT - if any line below reports 'Unknown command', STOP: gripper_macros.cfg is not included from printer.cfg and nothing in this file will actually grip. If the version printed is older than you expect, the INSTALLED copy has drifted from the repo. See docs/LAB.md.
M400 
GRIPPER_MACROS_VERSION
G4 P1500
M400 
GRIPPER_PING
G4 P1500
M400 
GRIPPER_STATUS
G4 P1500
G28 Z
G28 X Y
G0 F6000 Z5
M400 
M400 
GRIPPER_TRIALS_BEGIN NAME=offsets_z85 RATE=50 PLATE=0 CENTRE_X=69.5 OFFSETS=0 TRIALS=30 TRIALS_TOTAL=30 APPROACH_Z=65 GRIP_Z=85 RELEASE_Z=83 MA=500 HOLD=0.6 RANDOMISE=1 BOARD_INTERVAL_MS=20 SEED=1937305770
